WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Guile creates light Sonic Blade beside the knocked-down Cammy.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:00.900
Guile holds guard as Cammy starts to rise inside the Blade.

3
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.300
Guile blocks Cammy’s gold OD Cannon Spike wake-up reversal.

4
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.450
Cammy falls after the blocked reversal while Guile remains guarded.
